                                                "sense_id": "5400f297-8604-3b20-8049-10135bc24ed2",
                                                "text": "Within China, Wuhanese have become feared and discriminated against because of the epidemic. Yet the vast majority of people in Wuhan as well as the rest of China stick to meals of grains, tofu, pork and veg."
